  "What does light or heavy mean in 9:41, per Ibn Kathir?": { answer: "Whether it feels easy or hard", harder: ["Infiru khifafan wa thiqala, Quran 9:41: per Ibn Kathir, what does light or heavy mean?", "Thin or fat people", "Day or night", "Rich or poor towns"] },
